<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 25.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The index at 0650 GMT was 3381.01,22.54 points or 0.67 percent higher than Monday's close.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during this period and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
